1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:03,970
Developer chala gaya… aur saath mein aap ki website bhi.

2
00:00:04,415 --> 00:00:07,865
Bilal bhai ka developer, ek din phone band kar ke ghayab.

3
00:00:07,835 --> 00:00:13,605
Domain uske email pe. Code uske laptop mein. Server ka password, sirf usko pata.

4
00:00:14,052 --> 00:00:17,022
Ab Bilal bhai, apni hi website ke kiraye-daar hain.

5
00:00:17,256 --> 00:00:20,146
Teen cheezein, jo hamesha aap ke naam pe honi chahiye.

6
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:25,590
Pehli: domain. Registrar ka account, aap ki apni email pe.

7
00:00:25,824 --> 00:00:30,554
Doosri: code. GitHub ki repository, aap ke apne account mein.

8
00:00:30,654 --> 00:00:35,064
Teesri: hosting. Server ka login, aap ke apne haath mein.

9
00:00:35,484 --> 00:00:38,134
Paisa aap ka hai, to chaabi bhi aap ki.

10
00:00:38,688 --> 00:00:43,258
Teeno chaabiyan aap ke paas hain? Comment karo: mere paas, ya pata nahi.

11
00:00:43,495 --> 00:00:47,105
Apna setup check karwana hai? DM karo, free call pe dekh lete hain.

12
00:00:47,075 --> 00:00:51,165
Seedhi baat, no bakwaas. Localhost Labs.
